**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
/target
**/config.toml
**/data
**/*.list

# Agent worktrees. Claude Code checks out scratch worktrees here; they are
# throwaway copies of the repo (node_modules included) and are never registered
# with `git worktree`, so nothing prunes them for you.
.claude/worktrees/

# UI build artifacts
# `npm run build:web` writes the bundle the control plane embeds here; it is
# packaged for crates.io via did-hosting-control's `include` list, which is why
# `cargo publish` for that crate needs `--allow-dirty`.
#
# The UI's own artifacts (dist/, node_modules/, .expo/) are covered by
# did-hosting-ui/.gitignore, not from here.
did-hosting-control/ui-dist/

# Setup / VTA bootstrap artifacts (generated by setup + vta-request flows)
**/bootstrap-request.json
**/bootstrap-seed.bin
**/setup-offline-state.toml
**/bundle.armor
**/*.armor
**/sealed-export.txt
**/*-did.jsonl

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
